. * FE: OLS - no controls
. qui eststo est1: reghdfe ${yvar} ${xvar} lpimat ${cond}, absorb(${fe}) cluster(naics) nocons

. qui estadd local Weighted "No"

. qui estadd local FE "Yes"

. qui estadd local Trends "No"

. 
